              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolo suku insali yakwa-Israyeli nabaphunyukileyo bendlu kaJakobe abayikusala kuye owabachitha; kodwa iyohlala ngeqiniso kuJehova, oNgcwele ka-Israyeli.",
